{"ticker":"PRU","updated":"2026-10-30T23:07:10Z","profile":{"longName":"Prudential Financial, Inc.","shortName":"Prudential Financial, Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Life","country":"United States","website":"https://www.prudential.com","fullTimeEmployees":36607,"marketCap":40175247360,"trailingPE":10.548007,"forwardPE":8.377354,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.61595803,"pegRatio":0.86,"targetMeanPrice":107.6,"targetHighPrice":132.0,"targetLowPrice":87.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.141,"earningsGrowth":0.892,"grossMargins":0.29015,"operatingMargins":0.075219996,"profitMargins":0.06007,"totalRevenue":65223999488,"beta":0.84,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":127.72,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":91.89,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.79},"summary":"Prudential Financial, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides financial products and services in the United States, Japan and internationally. It operates through PGIM, Retirement Strategies, Group Insurance, Individual Life, and International Businesses segments. The PGIM segment offers investment management services and solutions related to public fixed income, public equity, real estate debt and equity, private credit and other alternatives, and multi-asset class strategies to institutional and retail clients, as well as its insurance and retirement businesses. The Retirement Strategies segment provides a range of retirement investment, and income products and services to retirement plan sponsors in the public, private, and not-for-profit sectors; group annuities and other products; international reinsurance; investment only products; and FlexGuard suite, Fixed annuities, and variable annuities, as well as develops and distributes individual variable and fixed annuity products. The Group Insurance segment offers various group life, and long-term and short-term group disability, as well as group corporate-, bank-, and trust-owned life insurance; and supplemental health solutions including accident, critical illness, and hospital indemnity. The Individual Life segment develops and distributes variable life, universal life, and term life insurance products. The Internati","summary_zh":"Prudential Financial, Inc. 及其子公司在美國、日本和國際上提供金融產品和服務。該公司透過 PGIM、退休策略、團體保險、個人壽險和國際業務部門進行營運。 PGIM部門為機構和零售客戶及其保險和退休業務提供與公共固定收益、公共股本、房地產債務和股本、私人信貸和其他另類投資以及多資產類別策略相關的投資管理服務和解決方案。退休策略部門為公共、私營和非營利部門的退休計畫發起人提供一系列退休投資、收入產品和服務；團體年金及其他產品；國際再保險；僅供投資的產品；和 FlexGuard 套件、固定年金和可變年金，以及開發和分銷個人可變和固定年金產品。團體保險部門提供各種團體人壽保險、長期和短期團體殘障保險，以及團體公司、銀行和信託人壽保險；以及補充健康解決方案，包括事故、重大疾病和住院賠償。個人壽險部門開發和分銷可變壽險、萬能壽險和定期壽險產品。國際組織","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險 - 壽險","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":108.73,"h":108.78,"l":106.2,"c":107.41,"v":2020300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":106.93,"h":107.73,"l":106.38,"c":107.43,"v":1427500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":107.97,"h":108.98,"l":107.25,"c":108.84,"v":1392400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":109.25,"h":109.37,"l":104.75,"c":105.71,"v":1633100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":105.37,"h":106.02,"l":103.81,"c":105.84,"v":1418100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":105.99,"h":106.8,"l":105.48,"c":105.54,"v":1071900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":105.3,"h":106.4,"l":105.03,"c":105.67,"v":1370500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":105.75,"h":107.11,"l":105.48,"c":106.99,"v":1461400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":106.82,"h":107.44,"l":106.38,"c":106.9,"v":1628300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":106.83,"h":107.4,"l":105.28,"c":105.45,"v":1805600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":105.4,"h":105.4,"l":101.64,"c":102.15,"v":2637300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":102.18,"h":104.34,"l":102.08,"c":103.01,"v":2052900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":103.3,"h":104.35,"l":102.88,"c":103.87,"v":1150600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":104.06,"h":104.25,"l":102.88,"c":103.59,"v":3063700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":102.93,"h":103.63,"l":102.68,"c":102.85,"v":1454700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":103.06,"h":104.3,"l":102.78,"c":103.13,"v":1301500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":103.13,"h":103.54,"l":102.78,"c":103.32,"v":1131100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":103.07,"h