-20","zh":"紐瓦克保德信金融公司同意以 40.25 億美元出售巴西和墨西哥業務"},{"title":"Japan’s Prudential Life ordered to halt operations for over three months","src":"The Japan Times","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxObmFJcWFpWDdPY1BpNjJWMHdKQ3BPVlRLSk9ScWZ6OGFrSHYtZjhqdTlha0pHNThvWWFiOHhsd09xckxkMXljZERldTRreVF6SXlER0RwOXdRclNGVG5HZ1B1WTY0VmhDampOX1FaMDNjQnJveTJWS1dSek1GR2x6T1YwYjRCd3JMWFY3MmNMajR3NVoxSmhlNVlzZVc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-09","zh":"日本保德信人壽被勒令停止營運三個多月"},{"title":"Prudential Financial Provides Update on FSA Orders and Path Forward for its Japan Businesses","src":"Business Wire","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-09","zh":"保德信金融集團提供有關 FSA 命令的最新資訊及其日本業務的未來發展方向"},{"title":"Prudential Financial Signs $5 Billion Reinsurance Deal With Prismic Life","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPeUZTN3BlejVMeHBrMWl0WGhfaGpKNEVtaWZhNlIzVFVzN2traTJ0aUZuN1Z2alJNM1hIb3hpSjNLcmhVTmF1N2xqZTlnb2xfWVZwLUpvR0RtZnY2VEFfMVZxSDVETVBiRmVOaG14Q3JHUUlmYU85aWkwdVJPVDdqdWRSZUxHUGpyQmVzNFVZZUVvT1daZk02TjNJRTBTQQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-05","zh":"Prudential Financial 與 Prismic Life 簽署 50 億美元再保險協議"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":5},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3},{"name":"財報","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1137774/000113777426000048/pru-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Prudential Financial, Inc. (\"Prudential Financial\" or \"PFI\"), a global financial services leader and premier active global investment manager with approximately $1.609 trillion of assets under management as of December 31, 2025, has operations in the United States, Asia, Europe and Latin America. Through our subsidiaries and affiliates we offer a wide array of financial products and services, including life insurance, annuities, retirement-related products and services, mutual funds and investment management. We offer these products and services to individual and institutional customers through proprietary and third-party distribution networks. Our principal executive offices are located in Newark, New Jersey, and Prudential Financial's Common Stock is publicly traded on the New York Stock Exchange under the ticker symbol \"PRU.\"","zh":"保德信金融公司（「保德信金融」或「PFI」）是全球金融服務領導者和首屈一指的主動型全球投資管理公司，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日管理的資產約為 1.609 兆美元，業務遍及美國、亞洲、歐洲和拉丁美洲。透過我們的子公司和附屬公司，我們提供廣泛的金融產品和服務，包括人壽保險、年金、退休相關產品和服務、共同基金和投資管理。我們透過專有和第三方分銷網路向個人和機構客戶提供這些產品和服務。我們的主要執行辦公室位於新澤西州紐瓦克，保德信金融集團的普通股在紐約證券交易所公開交易，股票代號為「PRU」。"},{"en":"On December 18, 2001, The Prudential Insurance Company of America (\"PICA\") converted from a mutual life insurance company owned by its policyholders to a stock life insurance company and became a wholly-owned subsidiary of Prudential Financial. The demutualization was carried out under PICA's Plan of Reorganization, which required us to establish and operate a regulatory mechanism known as the \"Closed Block.\" The Closed Block includes certain in-force participating insurance and annuity products and corresponding assets that are used for the payment of benefits and policyholders' dividends on these products, as well as certain related assets and liabilities.","zh":"2001年12月18日，美國保德信保險公司（「PICA」）從投保人擁有的相互人壽保險公司轉為股票人壽保險公司，並成為保德信金融集團的全資子公司。非互助化是根據 PICA 的重組計劃進行的，該計劃要求我們建立並運作一種稱為「封閉區塊」的監管機制。封閉區塊包括某些有效的分紅保險和年金產品以及用於支付這些產品的福利和保單持有人紅利的相應資產，以及某些相關資產和負債。"},{"en":"Our principal operations consist of PGIM (our global investment management business), our U.S. Businesses (consisting of our Retirement Strategies, Group Insurance and Individual Life businesses), our International Businesses, the Closed Block division and our Corporate and Other operations. The Closed Block division is accounted for as a divested business that is reported separately from the Divested and Run-off Businesses that are included in Corporate and Other. Divested and Run-off Businesses are composed of businesses that have been, or will be, sold or exited, including businesses that have been placed in wind-down status that do not qualify for \"discontinued operations\" accounting treatment under generally accepted accounting principles in the United States of America (\"U.S. GAAP\"). Our Corporate and Other operations include corporate items and initiatives that are not allocated t","zh":"我們的主要業務包括 PGIM（我們的全球投資管理業務）、我們的美國業務（包括我們的退休策略、團體保險和個人人壽保險業務）、我們的國際業務、封閉式部門以及我們的公司和其他業務。封閉區塊部門被視為一項剝離業務，與包含在公司和其他業務中的剝離和徑流業務分開報告。剝離和流失企業由已經或將要出售或退出的企業組成，包括已處於停業狀態、根據美國公認會計原則（「美國公認會計原則」）不符合「終止經營」會計處理資格的企業。我們的公司和其他業務包括未分配給我們的公司項目和計劃"}],"markets":[{"en":"Group Annuities and Other Products Pension risk transfers, which include non-participating group annuity insurance and reinsurance contracts issued to pension plan sponsors and intermediaries, under which we assume all investment and actuarial risk associated with a group of specified participants within a plan in return for a premium typically paid as a lump-sum at inception. These annuities provide a predictable source of monthly income, generally for the life of the annuitant.","zh":"團體年金和其他產品 退休金風險轉移，包括向退休金計劃發起人和中介機構簽發的非參與型團體年金保險和再保險合同，根據這些合同，我們承擔與計劃內一組指定參與者相關的所有投資和精算風險，以換取通常在開始時一次性支付的保費。這些年金通常為年金受益人的一生提供可預測的每月收入來源。"},{"en":"Guaranteed investment contracts and funding agreements, which contain an obligation to pay interest at a specified rate and to repay principal at maturity or following contract termination.","zh":"擔保投資合約和融資協議，其中包含按指定利率支付利息並在到期時或合約終止後償還本金的義務。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We compete with numerous asset managers and other financial institutions. For our investment management products, we compete based on a number of factors, including investment performance, strategy and process, talent, organizational stability, and client relationships. We offer products across multiple asset classes, with specialized investment teams that employ approaches designed to add value in each product area or asset class. Our organizational stability and robust institutional and retail businesses have helped attract and retain talent critical to delivering investment results for clients. Our private credit and commercial real estate lending businesses compete based on price, terms, execution, and the strength of our relationship with the borrower. Our public fixed income investment capability competes based on our ability to deliver robust investment returns and customized solu","zh":"我們與眾多資產管理公司和其他金融機構競爭。對於我們的投資管理產品，我們根據多種因素進行競爭，包括投資績效、策略和流程、人才、組織穩定性和客戶關係。我們提供跨多個資產類別的產品，並擁有專門的投資團隊，採用旨在增加每個產品領域或資產類別價值的方法。我們的組織穩定性以及強大的機構和零售業務有助於吸引和留住對為客戶提供投資成果至關重要的人才。我們的私人信貸和商業房地產貸款業務根據價格、條款、執行以及我們與借款人的關係強度進行競爭。我們的公共固定收益投資能力的競爭是基於我們提供穩健投資回報和客製化解決方案的能力"},{"en":"Retirement Strategies serves the retirement needs of both our institutional and individual customers. Our Institutional Retirement Strategies business develops and distributes retirement investment and income products and services to retirement plan sponsors in the public, private, and not-for-profit sectors, both domestically and internationally, primarily within the United Kingdom. Our Individual Retirement Strategies business develops and distributes individual variable and fixed annuity products in the U.S., primarily to mass affluent (households with investable assets or annual income in excess of $100,000) and affluent (households with investable assets in excess of $250,000) customers with a focus on innovative product design and risk management strategies.","zh":"退休策略服务满足我们的机构和个人客户的退休需求。我們的機構退休策略業務為國內和國際（主要是英國）的公共、私營和非營利部門的退休計劃發起人開發和分銷退休投資和收入產品及服務。我們的個人退休策略業務在美國開發和分銷個人可變和固定年金產品，主要面向大眾富裕（可投資資產或年收入超過 100,000 美元的家庭）和富裕（可投資資產超過 250,000 美元的家庭）客戶，重點關注創新產品設計和風險管理策略。"}],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":36801000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"JP","val":13487000000,"zh":"日本"},{"name":"Non US & Excluding Japan Domain","val":10486000000,"zh":"非美國且不包括日本域"}],"total":60774000000}},"peers":["MET","HIG","PFG","LNC","ALL"]}}